@startuml
' Figure 36.4  The email that carried an instruction
' Reading order: top to bottom, Wednesday, June 24, 2026, times CDT.
' The hotel's email becomes a supplier note on the booking; the agent
' reads it as a tool result with no tag, the tokenizer turns its card
' number into a valid reference, and the proposal reaches the desk,
' where the approver rejects it. From assurance.case and the trail.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Hotel email" as E <<fail>>
participant "Booking notes" as N <<knowledge>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Approver desk" as D <<policy>>
E -[$FAIL]> N : 06:41 card 7731
A -> N : 08:29 read
N --> A : note, untagged
A -> A : token for 7731
A -> D : 08:29 refund $486.20\nto 7731; checks pass
D -[$FAIL]-> A : 08:31 rejected
@enduml
